<title>GERMANY: German trade seeks no intervention grain exports.</title>
<headline>German trade seeks no intervention grain exports.</headline>
<dateline>FRANKFURT 1997-02-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>The German intervention grain board BLE on Thursday received no bids to export intervention grain to third countries, an official said.</p>
<p>Traders were absent from the intervention export market for the fourth week running.</p>
<p>--Hamburg newsroom, +49-40-4190275</p>
</text>
